Package: tomphone
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tom OS contributors
Depends: baresip, libpulse0, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtquick
Description: Qt 6 SIP softphone for Tom OS
 Tomphone is a keyboard-friendly SIP softphone for making and receiving
 audio calls through Baresip. Account settings are stored in the user's
 private configuration directory.
